## Signature

- Provided by: **Big Pickle (opencode/big-pickle)** — 2026-10-22
- Method: public internet research, cross-checked across four independent source classes —
  (1) Anthropic's official documentation surface: the models overview
  (`docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/about-claude/models/all-models`, lineup Fable 5.1 / Opus 5 /
  Sonnet 5 / Haiku 4.5, API id `claude-sonnet-5`), the Claude Platform model page
  (`platform.claude.com/docs/en/models/sonnet-5/overview` — Sonnet 5, 1M ctx, 128K out,
  $2/$10, cutoff Jan 2026, legacy status), the Anthropic release-notes overview (Sonnet 3 →
  3.5 → 3.7 → 4 → 4.5 → 4.6 → 5 → 5.5, no 5.4), the pricing sheet (no 5.4 SKU; the $3/$15
  Sonnet 5 price explicitly cancelled on 2026-08-10), the system-card index and the
  transparency-hub model report; a request for `/docs/en/models/sonnet-5-4/overview` returns
  Anthropic's "not found" documentation page. (2) Cloud-provider catalogues: Google Cloud
  Vertex AI's Claude model list exposes `sonnet-4-5`, `sonnet-4-6`, `sonnet-5`, `sonnet-5-5`
  and no `sonnet-5-4`. (3) Aggregator catalogues: the OpenCode Zen model list and
  `/zen/v1/models` (86 ids) contain `claude-sonnet-5` and `claude-sonnet-5-5` but no
  `claude-sonnet-5-4`; OpenRouter's `/api/v1/models` (468 ids) lists
  `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5` and `anthropic/claude-sonnet-5.5` only; the Hugging Face Hub
  model search returns no `claude-sonnet-5.4` checkpoint. (4) Independent trackers and
  reviews: no LMArena / Artificial Analysis / Epoch / Terminal-Bench entry for a 5.4 — the only
  "5.4" mentions found are one low-credibility wiki article asserting a "Claude Sonnet 5.4 →
  5.5" transition, two blog posts from March/April 2026 crediting a "Claude Sonnet 5.4
  Extended" chat session (both pre-date Anthropic's own 2026-06-30 Sonnet 5 release, so they
  cannot describe an official 5.4 checkpoint), and AI-generated code-farm pages whose model
  catalogues pair "claude-sonnet-5.4" with impossible ids such as `claude-sonnet-5-6` and
  `anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-9`. Scores are withheld because zero verified public benchmark
  numbers exist for this exact id.
- Future sources: add a new file next to this one, e.g. `GPT_5.md`, using the same headings.
